# Credentials for the Come With scripts. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in
# the one blank. `.env` is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# YOU DO NOT NEED THIS FILE TO MAKE A VIDEO. The render tool works without it —
# an episode folder carries a read-only token for its own episode, which is
# enough to build the tracklist and render. This file is only for the things
# that WRITE to production:
#
#   * tracklist_from_txt.py --write-order   (fix the site's running order)
#   * the SQL helpers in Radio/render/
#   * deploying edge functions
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SBP_PAT is a Supabase MANAGEMENT token. It can run arbitrary SQL against
# production and deploy or delete edge functions. It is not a database login.
#
# DON'T COPY THE ONE FROM YOUR OTHER MACHINE. Mint a second one, so each
# machine has its own and a lost laptop is one revocation rather than a
# password change everywhere:
#
#     https://supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens  ->  Generate new token
#     Name it after the machine, e.g. "keith-laptop-2"
#
# Never paste it into Slack, email, or a chat message.
SBP_PAT=

# Everything below is public — these exact values are served to every visitor
# in radio.html. They are here so the scripts can find the project.
SBP_REF_PROD=yaytdosxfhcqatmhctzk
SUPABASE_PROD_URL=https://yaytdosxfhcqatmhctzk.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PROD_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_IkigzWOTU3ZSMK9DxqwwJw_AaQkShCi
